### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### Get leaderboard sorted by wins (default)
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaderboard

### Get leaderboard sorted by win percentage
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaderboard?sortBy=winPercentage

### Get leaderboard sorted by total matches
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaderboard?sortBy=totalMatches

### Get leaderboard sorted by ELO rating
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaderboard?sortBy=eloRating

### Get leaderboard with pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaderboard?sortBy=wins&page=1&limit=3